cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research, please cite it as below."
title: "hme20-root-research: root feasibility study of a Huawei Mate 20 (HMA-AL00, Kirin 980) on HarmonyOS 4.0.0"
abstract: >-
  A documented negative result: no pure-software path to uid 0 was found for a fully
  updated Huawei Mate 20 without disassembly. Includes per-CVE applicability analysis
  against the vendor's published GPL kernel source, a SELinux ioctl-access audit, and an
  offline QEMU ARM64 reproduction environment for CVE-2025-38352 that did not achieve a
  use-after-free.
